// Tidecall of Danalin (docs/DECKS.md 3.2 and 9.1: Prophet, band II, needs Message from the Deep;
// 10.4: the Drown becomes a ritual in a coastal city; DECKS_ROUND8.md C.2: water is Coast). The
// ritual, repeatable, built in a coastal city, leaves a charge there (`ritual_charge`); a unit in
// that city spends it on a flat land plot within 3 plots of the city, next to water, with no city or
// unique feature, that its team sees: the plot becomes Coast for good (its improvement, feature,
// route and land resource are lost; units that cannot be on water move to the nearest land).
// Rules: crates/ffh-core/src/ffh/cards/world_spells_2.rs.
