  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_TIDECALL_OF_DANALIN": "Tidecall of Danalin",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_TIDECALL_OF_DANALIN_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Allows the Tidecall of Danalin ritual in coastal cities (150 [ICON_PRODUCTION], repeatable).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Each completion: a unit in its city turns a flat land plot within 3 plots of the city, next to water, into Coast for good. Not a city's plot or a unique feature's. Its improvement, feature, route and land resource are lost; units that cannot be on water move to the nearest land.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_TIDECALL_OF_DANALIN_PEDIA": "The prophet calls the tide by Danalin's name, and the sea comes in and does not go out again.",
