    "TXT_KEY_PROJECT_TIDECALL_OF_DANALIN_STRATEGY": "[ICON_BULLET]Coastal cities only.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Each completion: a unit in this city turns a flat land plot within 3 plots of it, next to water, into Coast for good.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Not while the city holds a Tidecall not yet cast.",
